{"logId": "e96639fb-a4c4-4d71-8a0b-a2259e4bb2ef", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "回顾胖东来多年来的发展之路，不正是靠一年又一年、“一点一滴”，脚踏实地的实干，才一步步从当初的一个人、20平方米的房子，逐步壮大为今日的上万名员工、20个分店的宏大规模吗？", "block_bbox": [238, 228, 1016, 325], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 228.0], [1016.0, 228.0], [1016.0, 325.0], [238.0, 325.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "实干出成效，点滴积伟业。这是胖东来人走过的成功之路，也是每个成功的企业必经的轨迹。", "block_bbox": [239, 333, 1015, 394], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 333.0], [1015.0, 333.0], [1015.0, 394.0], [239.0, 394.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "“财散人聚，财聚人散”", "block_bbox": [291, 437, 544, 467], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[291.0, 437.0], [544.0, 437.0], [544.0, 467.0], [291.0, 467.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "读《东来致顾客的一封信》随想之三", "block_bbox": [279, 473, 678, 503], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[279.0, 473.0], [678.0, 473.0], [678.0, 503.0], [279.0, 503.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [72, 603, 224, 727], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[72.0, 603.0], [224.0, 603.0], [224.0, 727.0], [72.0, 727.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "做生意的人，依法获利，积利而富，无可非议。", "block_bbox": [279, 542, 680, 568], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[279.0, 542.0], [680.0, 542.0], [680.0, 568.0], [279.0, 568.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "但是，一个偌大商场的可观盈利，不是靠一个人的功劳获得的。利多了，如何看待和公平合理地分配这些利，往往是个棘手的问题，人们常说“生意好做，伙计难搁”。伙计难搁”的一个重要原因，恐怕就在这里。", "block_bbox": [238, 577, 1016, 674], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 577.0], [1016.0, 577.0], [1016.0, 674.0], [238.0, 674.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "于东来的体会是：钱，只不过是身外之物，生不带来，死不带走。他说：“回顾多年来走过的路，我深深地明白了，‘财散人聚，财聚人散’的道理。财富是大家共同创造的，带领大家在创造更大财富的同时，让更多的人成为企业的主人，去拥有财富，享受财富，体验人生的意义和价值。”", "block_bbox": [238, 682, 1017, 814], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 682.0], [1017.0, 682.0], [1017.0, 814.0], [238.0, 814.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [293, 830, 943, 1244], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[293.0, 830.0], [943.0, 830.0], [943.0, 1244.0], [293.0, 1244.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9373131990432739, "coordinate": [238, 228, 1016, 325], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 228.0], [1016.0, 228.0], [1016.0, 325.0], [238.0, 325.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9069039225578308, "coordinate": [239, 333, 1015, 394], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 333.0], [1015.0, 333.0], [1015.0, 394.0], [239.0, 394.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6348048448562622, "coordinate": [291, 437, 544, 467], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[291.0, 437.0], [544.0, 437.0], [544.0, 467.0], [291.0, 467.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6979673504829407, "coordinate": [279, 473, 678, 503], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[279.0, 473.0], [678.0, 473.0], [678.0, 503.0], [279.0, 503.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.3743751347064972, "coordinate": [72, 603, 224, 727], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[72.0, 603.0], [224.0, 603.0], [224.0, 727.0], [72.0, 727.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8231428265571594, "coordinate": [279, 542, 680, 568], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[279.0, 542.0], [680.0, 542.0], [680.0, 568.0], [279.0, 568.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9358751177787781, "coordinate": [238, 577, 1016, 674], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 577.0], [1016.0, 577.0], [1016.0, 674.0], [238.0, 674.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9472870826721191, "coordinate": [238, 682, 1017, 814], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 682.0], [1017.0, 682.0], [1017.0, 814.0], [238.0, 814.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.7018041014671326, "coordinate": [293, 830, 943, 1244], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[293.0, 830.0], [943.0, 830.0], [943.0, 1244.0], [293.0, 1244.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "回顾胖东来多年来的发展之路，不正是靠一年又一年、“一点一滴”，脚踏实地的实干，才一步步从当初的一个人、20平方米的房子，逐步壮大为今日的上万名员工、20个分店的宏大规模吗？\n\n实干出成效，点滴积伟业。这是胖东来人走过的成功之路，也是每个成功的企业必经的轨迹。\n\n## “财散人聚，财聚人散”\n\n## 读《东来致顾客的一封信》随想之三\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_72_603_224_727.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n做生意的人，依法获利，积利而富，无可非议。\n\n但是，一个偌大商场的可观盈利，不是靠一个人的功劳获得的。利多了，如何看待和公平合理地分配这些利，往往是个棘手的问题，人们常说“生意好做，伙计难搁”。伙计难搁”的一个重要原因，恐怕就在这里。\n\n于东来的体会是：钱，只不过是身外之物，生不带来，死不带走。他说：“回顾多年来走过的路，我深深地明白了，‘财散人聚，财聚人散’的道理。财富是大家共同创造的，带领大家在创造更大财富的同时，让更多的人成为企业的主人，去拥有财富，享受财富，体验人生的意义和价值。”\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_293_830_943_1244.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"54%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_72_603_224_727.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e96639fb-a4c4-4d71-8a0b-a2259e4bb2ef/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_72_603_224_727.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A31%3A04Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff8a24baaf5d1a5687d2b60eafb81d9d099d902589f358672309a59f7884ef87d", "imgs/img_in_image_box_293_830_943_1244.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e96639fb-a4c4-4d71-8a0b-a2259e4bb2ef/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_293_830_943_1244.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A31%3A04Z%2F-1%2F%2F29015d467e5331c3e0ddece40ddf95082514cb3d833373b795492d152525e4b5"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e96639fb-a4c4-4d71-8a0b-a2259e4bb2ef/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A31%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2F5ea5f816e1ed7512511f7456c439fa151ec78224c2a5144859ed129daf554491"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e96639fb-a4c4-4d71-8a0b-a2259e4bb2ef/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A31%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2F803dcd954a94927c87606a2021c10deed1a148efbc99f814f45f8639d95a14c6"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e96639fb-a4c4-4d71-8a0b-a2259e4bb2ef/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A31%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd0a2a2deea5537e9710ac47f42abf0e08d99455b6aff0b68e3554ea217c5926c"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
